text Naranja_CuevaDeCristal_G24_M04_Text_0819434F {
    "Sto.MARA: Asì que eres \nun ladrón de Pokémon…\pQueda usted detenid{RIVAL}\npor entrar en area prohibida.\p{COLOR 0x04}¡No Sargento Mara!\pSoy un ENTRENADOR POKéMON.\pMe llamo {PLAYER} KETCHUM\ny soy de Pueblo PALETA.\pLlegué atrapad{RIVAL} por los remolinos."
}

text Naranja_CuevaDeCristal_G24_M04_Text_081944C5 {
    "... ...\pWhy can’t they keep digging?\nIs the bedrock too hard?\pMy beloved awaits me in VERDANTURF\nTOWN just beyond here...\pIf RUSTBORO and VERDANTURF were\njoined by this tunnel, I could visit\lher every day...\pBut this...\nWhat am I to do?"
}

text Naranja_CuevaDeCristal_G24_M04_Text_081945B2 {
    "To get from RUSTBORO to VERDANTURF,\nyou need to go to DEWFORD, then pass\lthrough SLATEPORT and MAUVILLE..."
}

text Naranja_CuevaDeCristal_G24_M04_Text_0819461D {
    "Wow! You shattered that boulder\nblocking the way.\pTo show you how much I appreciate it,\nI’d like you to have this HM."
}

text Naranja_CuevaDeCristal_G24_M04_Text_08194693 {
    "That HM contains STRENGTH.\pIf a muscular POKéMON were to learn\nthat, it would be able to move even\llarge boulders."
}

text Naranja_CuevaDeCristal_G24_M04_Text_08194706 {
    "WANDA!\nNow I can see you anytime!\pWANDA: That’s...wonderful.\pPlease, take some rest at my home."
}

text Naranja_CuevaDeCristal_G24_M04_Text_08194766 {
    "On the other side of this rock...\nMy boyfriend is there.\pHe... He’s not just digging the tunnel\nto come see me.\pHe works his hands raw and rough\nfor the benefit of everyone."
}

text Naranja_CuevaDeCristal_G24_M04_Text_08194814 {
    "What do you call a wild man up in the\nmountains? A mountain man, right?\pSo why don’t they call a POKéMON in the\nmountains a mountain POKéMON?"
}

text Naranja_CuevaDeCristal_G24_M04_Text_081948A2 {
    "My POKéMON...\nRan out of power..."
}

text Naranja_CuevaDeCristal_G24_M04_Text_081948C4 {
    "They halted development here to\nprotect POKéMON, right?\lThere’s a feel-good story!"
}

text Naranja_CuevaDeCristal_G24_M04_Text_086B2900 {
    "Guau!\pEste el Onix de cristal del que me habló\naquella niña.\p¡¡El {COLOR 0x06}Onix de cristal {COLOR 0x01}te está atacando!"
}

text Naranja_CuevaDeCristal_G24_M04_Text_086C081B {
    "{COLOR 0x07}JAMES: Ya tenemos el guión  \ndel espectáculo que haremos\len cuanto robemos\lestos raros POKéMON rosas.\p¿Lo quieres ver?\p¡Nada puede fallar!\p¡No durarás ni un asalto!"
}
